me on the Tyrrhenian Sea, and many Romans spend the summer holidays there. It is entirely situated within the municipality of Rome and is the city's seaside resort.","wpu":"Ostia (Rome)","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Ostia.jpg/960px-Ostia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},"wk":"2026-10-18"}